    "form_field_metadata_context": {
      "description": "### Impact\r\n\r\nAn attacker who uses this vulnerability can craft a PDF which leads to large memory usage and/or long runtimes. This requires retrieving the form fields of a document.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\n\r\nThis has been fixed in [pypdf==6.21.0](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/releases/tag/6.21.0).\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\n\r\nIf you cannot upgrade yet, consider applying the changes from PR [#4219](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/pull/4219).",
